msgstr "circulation.pref#UpdateNotForLoanStatusOnCheckin# _ALL_:<br/>"

# Circulation > Checkout policy > UpdateNotForLoanStatusOnCheckout
msgid "circulation.pref#UpdateNotForLoanStatusOnCheckout# Each pair of values should be on a separate line."
msgstr "circulation.pref#UpdateNotForLoanStatusOnCheckout# តម្លៃគូនីមួយៗគួរតែស្ថិតនៅលើបន្ទាត់ដាច់ដោយឡែកមួយ។"

